New:
• "Teams" are now called groups. If you share your location, you show up in all your groups at once.
• Invites, roles and removals take effect right away.
• New role: group manager, who looks after the group's people and invites.
• The owner chooses the administrators on a new screen.
• The map has softer colors and shows the OpenStreetMap credit.
• When signing in, the organization search shows only after you pick your account.
